                        <p>
                          The real star of the show at 3D4E isn't the cool projects that we do or the machinery we own.
                          The people who help run this deserve the real credit. 
                        </p>
                        <p>
                          They help out in all different roles, from our lab managers who keep our printers running 14/6 (maintenance is important),
                          our project leads who make sure students get the skills and experiences out of their projects,
                          our tech instructors who teach CAD to every student no matter the background,
                          our social and outreach team who make sure our impact is large and noticed,
                          and executive board who lubricate the gears between every group. Every person here plays a crucial role.
                        </p>
                        <p>If you get the chance, say hi to us when you meet us! We love to chat with people.</p>
